#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md
msgid "templates, remix, react router v7, framework mode, ssr, loader, action"
msgstr "テンプレート, remix, react router v7, framework mode, ssr, loader, action"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md:7
msgid "Remix / React Router v7"
msgstr "Remix / React Router v7"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md:9
msgid ""
"A React Router v7 template in Framework mode (the next iteration of "
"Remix). Loaders, components, and the root layout live under `app/`; "
"ReScript provides both the home loader and the Greet component. SSR is on"
" by default through `@react-router/dev`'s Vite plugin and runs in "
"production via `@react-router/serve`."
msgstr ""
"React Router v7 を Framework モード (Remix の後継) で使うテンプレートです。Loader / コンポーネント / "
"ルートレイアウトは `app/` 配下に置かれ、ReScript がホームの Loader と Greet コンポーネントを担います。"
"SSR は `@react-router/dev` の Vite プラグインで既定有効、本番は `@react-router/serve` 経由で動作します。"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md:11
msgid "Generated layout"
msgstr "生成されるレイアウト"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md:32
msgid "Key files"
msgstr "主なファイル"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md:34
msgid ""
"`app/root.tsx` — Defines the `Layout` and the `App` shell shared by every"
" route."
msgstr ""
"`app/root.tsx` — 全ルートで共有する `Layout` と `App` シェルを定義します。"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md:35
msgid ""
"`app/routes.ts` — Explicit route registry using helpers from `@react-"
"router/dev/routes`. Mounts `routes/home.tsx` as `index`."
msgstr ""
"`app/routes.ts` — `@react-router/dev/routes` のヘルパーを使ったルート明示登録。"
"`routes/home.tsx` を `index` としてマウントします。"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md:36
msgid ""
"`app/routes/home.tsx` — Home route. Uses the typed `Route` namespace "
"generated by `react-router typegen`; consumes the ReScript loader and "
"component through their compiled `.res.mjs` artifacts."
msgstr ""
"`app/routes/home.tsx` — ホームルート。`react-router typegen` が生成する型付き `Route` "
"名前空間を使い、ReScript の Loader とコンポーネントを `.res.mjs` 経由で読み込みます。"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md:37
msgid ""
"`app/loaders/HomeLoader.res` — Sample loader written in ReScript so the "
"route can keep its TSX glue thin and unit-test the loader on its own."
msgstr ""
"`app/loaders/HomeLoader.res` — ReScript で書かれたサンプル Loader。ルート側の TSX "
"グルーを薄く保ち、Loader 単体でユニットテスト可能にします。"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md:38
msgid ""
"`vite.config.ts` — Just the `reactRouter()` plugin — `@vitejs/plugin-"
"react` is unnecessary because the router plugin already configures the "
"React refresh runtime."
msgstr ""
"`vite.config.ts` — `reactRouter()` プラグインのみ。router プラグインが React refresh "
"ランタイムを設定済みのため `@vitejs/plugin-react` は不要です。"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md:40
msgid "npm scripts"
msgstr "npm スクリプト"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md
msgid "Command"
msgstr "コマンド"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "説明"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md
msgid "`dev`"
msgstr "`dev`"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md
msgid "Start `react-router dev` with `rescript -w`."
msgstr "`rescript -w` と並行して `react-router dev` を起動します。"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md
msgid "`build`"
msgstr "`build`"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md
msgid "Compile ReScript and run `react-router build`."
msgstr "ReScript をコンパイルしてから `react-router build` を実行します。"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md
msgid "`start`"
msgstr "`start`"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md
msgid "Serve the production bundle through `@react-router/serve`."
msgstr "`@react-router/serve` 経由で本番バンドルを配信します。"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md
msgid "`typecheck`"
msgstr "`typecheck`"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md
msgid "Generate route types and run `tsc --noEmit`."
msgstr "ルート型を生成してから `tsc --noEmit` を実行します。"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md
msgid "`test`"
msgstr "`test`"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md
msgid "Run Vitest."
msgstr "Vitest を実行します。"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md:50
msgid "Day-two pointers"
msgstr "Day-two ポインタ"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md:52
msgid ""
"**Add routes** — extend `app/routes.ts` with `route(\":id\", "
"\"routes/show.tsx\")`, `layout(\"routes/dashboard.tsx\", [...])`, etc. "
"Run `pnpm typecheck` after edits to refresh the typed `+types/...` "
"modules."
msgstr ""
"**ルート追加** — `app/routes.ts` を `route(\":id\", \"routes/show.tsx\")`、"
"`layout(\"routes/dashboard.tsx\", [...])` などで拡張します。編集後は "
"`pnpm typecheck` を実行して型付き `+types/...` モジュールをリフレッシュしてください。"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md:53
msgid ""
"**Add actions** — export `export async function action(args: "
"Route.ActionArgs)` from a route file and post to it from a `<Form "
"method=\"post\">`."
msgstr ""
"**Action 追加** — ルートファイルで `export async function action(args: "
"Route.ActionArgs)` をエクスポートし、`<Form method=\"post\">` から POST します。"

#: ../../user/templates/remix-v7.md:54
msgid ""
"**Switch to SPA mode** — set `ssr: false` in `react-router.config.ts` for"
" client-only deployments."
msgstr ""
"**SPA モードへ切り替え** — クライアント専用デプロイの場合は `react-router.config.ts` で `ssr: false` "
"を指定します。"
